message: "If you use this repository, please cite the associated article."
title: "GenAI Models Capture Urban Science but Oversimplify Complexity"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-25
repository-code: "https://github.com/24kchengYe/AI4UrbanScience"
url: "https://github.com/24kchengYe/AI4UrbanScience"
abstract: >-
  AI4UrbanScience provides released source tables, diagnostic figure rerenders,
  validation workflows and numerical recomputation for an empirical evaluation
  of GenAI-generated urban data and controlled interventions across four urban-science cases.
keywords:
  - urban science
  - generative artificial intelligence
  - urban data
  - synthetic data
  - spatial analysis
  - multimodal models
  - model interpretability
  - reproducible research
